,"bearing_deg":238.0,"in_corridor":null,"resolution":"not traced: wind too light to trace (1.4 mph)"}],"search_scope":"Searched every STEERS emissions event starting 03/06/2025 in Harris County (1 found; search complete). Also searched reports that started in the 30 days before and were still running (1 open that day; earlier search complete). Wind too light to trace (1.4 mph): no corridor drawn, so the search is incomplete. A report open at that time could not be located, so the search is incomplete.","status":"search_incomplete","incident":null,"matched_facility_id":null,"source_url":"https://www2.tceq.texas.gov/oce/eer/","checks":[{"at":"T+24h","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (1.4 mph)"},{"at":"T+14d","status":"search_incomplete","note":"wind too light to trace (1.4 mph)"}],"reported":null},"corridor":{"origin_site_id":"48_201_0036","half_width_deg":22.5,"max_km":15.0,"wind_from_deg":[318.0,318.0]},"packet":{"draft_en":"On March 6, 2025, the Texas state monitor at Channelview Drive Water Tower recorded 15.42 ppb of benzene in the 12:00 a.m. CST hour, against a 7-day median of 0.71 ppb. Wind there came from 318 degrees at 1.4 mph. The wind was too light to trace where the air came from, so no upwind corridor is drawn. No matching report was found in the records checked; the search is incomplete. Requested follow-up: confirm whether any facility in this corridor reported a release that hour.","draft_es":"El 6 de marzo de 2025, el monitor estatal de Texas en Channelview Drive Water Tower registró 15.42 ppb de benceno en la hora de las 12:00 a. m. CST, frente a una mediana de 7 días de 0.71 ppb. El viento venía de 318 grados a 1.4 mph. El viento era demasiado débil para saber de dónde venía el aire, así que no se traza un corredor. No se encontró un informe correspondiente en los registros revisados; la búsqueda está incompleta. Seguimiento solicitado: confirmar si alguna instalación en este corredor reportó una emisión a esa hora.","draf